{"step_index":48,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:50Z","input_tokens":2384,"cache_read_tokens":53314,"output_tokens":11136,"thinking":"Keyframes are generated, representing the hero device, a Dhaka street scene, and a 999 dispatch console. This visual foundation allows for immediate update of the target commercial video, allowing alignment with the key visuals. Ready to initiate the video update process.\n\n\nInitial focus is on integrating the three image assets into the video framework. Scene-specific canvas rendering logic will handle Ken Burns effects, cross-dissolves, and animated overlays. The HTML structure is examined to verify image loading is handled correctly.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Comprehensive 60-second Apple Event style commercial video player and generator incorporating real photorealistic AI-generated keyframe visuals, Ken Burns cinematic transitions, real-time Web Audio scoring, voiceover narration, and one-click video download.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>SAFE BD — Official 60s Commercial (Apple Event Master)</title>\n  <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap');\n    \n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Display', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    }\n    \n    .glow-red {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.45);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#060305] text-[#f8fafc] antialiased min-h-screen p-3 md:p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n\n  <!-- Main Player Container -->\n  <div class=\"w-full max-w-5xl bg-[#0f070b]/95 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-2xl flex flex-col\">\n    \n    <!-- Top Bar -->\n    <div class=\"px-6 py-3.5 border-b border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between bg-black/50\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500 shadow-[0_0_12px_#ef4444] animate-pulse\"></span>\n        <span class=\"text-xs md:text-sm font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase text-red-400\">SAFE BD • Official Brand Film</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:gap-3 text-xs text-slate-400\">\n        <span class=\"hidden sm:inline bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-mono text-[11px]\">Apple Keynote 4K Master</span>\n        <span class=\"font-mono text-red-300 font-bold\">0:60 Extended Film</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Video Canvas Viewport (16:9) -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-video bg-black overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center group\" id=\"videoContainer\">\n      <canvas id=\"stageCanvas\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" class=\"w-full h-full block object-contain\"></canvas>\n\n      <!-- Glassmorphic HUD -->\n      <div id=\"hudOverlay\" class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none flex flex-col justify-between p-5 md:p-8 transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100 z-10\">\n        <!-- Top Left Chapter & CAD Badges -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <div id=\"sceneBadge\" class=\"bg-black/70 border border-white/20 text-white text-[11px] md:text-xs px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md uppercase tracking-wider font-bold\">\n            Scene 01 • Streets at Dusk\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"cadBadge\" class=\"hidden bg-red-950/80 border border-red-500/40 text-red-300 text-[11px] md:text-xs px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md font-mono flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-ping\"></span> 999 CAD LINKED\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Dynamic Subtitles Container -->\n        <div class=\"w-full flex justify-center pb-2\">\n          <div id=\"subtitleBox\" class=\"bg-black/80 border border-white/20 px-6 py-2.5 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-xl text-center max-w-3xl text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-slate-100 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300\">\n            \"Every day, millions of us step out into the world...\"\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Start / Paused Overlay -->\n      <div id=\"startOverlay\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/75 backdrop-blur-md flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center z-20\">\n        <div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(239,68,68,0.7)] cursor-pointer transform hover:scale-105 transition active:scale-95 mb-5\" id=\"bigPlayBtn\">\n          <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 translate-x-0.5 fill-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight\">SAFE BD — \"Peace of Mind\"</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-lg mt-2 leading-relaxed\">\n          The 60-second Apple Event commercial featuring photorealistic visual scenes, dynamic camera motion, synthesized score, and spoken narration.\n        </p>\n        <button id=\"quickStartBtn\" class=\"mt-6 px-7 py-2.5 bg-white text-black font-bold text-xs md:text-sm rounded-full hover:bg-slate-200 transition shadow-xl flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play Commercial (With Sound)\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Exporting Status Pill -->\n      <div id=\"recordingTag\" class=\"hidden absolute top-4 right-4 bg-red-600/90 text-white font-mono text-xs px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full flex items-center gap-2 z-30 shadow-lg\">\n        <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white animate-pulse\"></span> EXPORTING VIDEO...\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scrubber & Controls -->\n    <div class=\"px-6 py-4 bg-[#0a0408] border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n      \n      <!-- Progress Bar -->\n      <div class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <span id=\"timeCurrent\" class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 w-10 text-right\">0:00</span>\n        <div class=\"relative flex-1 h-2.5 bg-white/10 rounded-full cursor-pointer overflow-hidden group\" id=\"progressBarContainer\">\n          <div id=\"progressBar\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 via-red-500 to-amber-500 rounded-full w-0 transition-all duration-75\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <span id=\"timeDuration\" class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 w-10\">1:00</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Action Buttons -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-1\">\n        \n        <!-- Left: Play/Pause/Restart & Voice Toggle -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <button id=\"ctrlPlayBtn\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white flex items-center justify-center transition border border-white/10\">\n            <svg id=\"playIcon\" class=\"w-5 h-5 fill-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg>\n            <svg id=\"pauseIcon\" class=\"w-5 h-5 fill-current hidden\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 19h4V5H6v14zm8-14v14h4V5h-4z\"/></svg>\n          </button>\n          \n          <button id=\"ctrlRestartBtn\" class=\"p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition\" title=\"Restart\">\n            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 fill-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 5V1L7 6l5 5V7c3.31 0 6 2.69 6 6s-2.69 6-6 6-6-2.69-6-6H4c0 4.42 3.58 8 8 8s8-3.58 8-8-3.58-8-8-8z\"/></svg>\n          </button>\n\n          <button id=\"voiceToggleBtn\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-slate-300 hover:bg-white/10 transition\">\n            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current text-red-400\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 9v6h4l5 5V4L7 9H3zm13.5 3c0-1.77-1.02-3.29-2.5-4.03v8.05c1.48-.73 2.5-2.25 2.5-4.02z\"/></svg>\n            <span id=\"voiceStatusText\">Voice: ON</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Center: Chapter Jumps -->\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          <button onclick=\"seekTo(0)\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 rounded-md text-slate-300\">01. Streets</button>\n          <button onclick=\"seekTo(8)\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 rounded-md text-slate-300\">02. Vulnerability</button>\n          <button onclick=\"seekTo(17)\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 rounded-md text-slate-300\">03. Reveal</button>\n          <button onclick=\"seekTo(22)\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 rounded-md text-red-300 border border-red-500/30\">04. Covert SOS</button>\n          <button onclick=\"seekTo(34)\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 rounded-md text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30\">05. Walk With Me</button>\n          <button onclick=\"seekTo(52)\" class=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 rounded-md text-slate-300\">06. Safe Return</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right: Export Video -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <button id=\"downloadVideoBtn\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-red-700 hover:from-red-500 hover:to-red-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-red-900/40 transition transform hover:scale-102 active:scale-98\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96zM17 13l-5 5-5-5h3V9h4v4h3z\"/></svg>\n            <span>Export &amp; Download Video</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Footer Specs -->\n    <div class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-black/60 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-400 gap-2\">\n      <div>\n        <strong>SAFE BD</strong>: National Citizen Safety, Covert SOS &amp; Live Transit Platform • <em>Saad Rizwan, Founder &amp; CEO</em>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <span>Integrated with: <strong>999 Emergency CAD</strong></span>\n        <span>Visual Render: <strong>Cinematic 1080p 60 FPS</strong></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Client-Side Motion Graphics Engine -->\n  <script>\n    // --- Asset Loading ---\n    const imgStreet = new Image();\n    imgStreet.src = 'dhaka_cinematic_commuter_v2_1791911903427.jpg';\n\n    const imgHero = new Image();\n    imgHero.src = 'safe_bd_hero_promo_1791911780793.jpg';\n\n    const imgCad = new Image();\n    imgCad.src = 'dhaka_999_cad_console_1791911921827.jpg';\n\n    // --- Timeline Definitions ---\n    const TIMELINE = [\n      {\n        start: 0,\n        end: 8,\n        title: \"Scene 01 • Streets at Dusk\",\n        subtitle: \"Every day, millions of us step out into the world. Commuting late. Returning from campus. Navigating the unpredictable.\",\n        type: \"streets\"\n      },\n      {\n        start: 8,\n        end: 17,\n        title: \"Scene 02 • The Critical Vulnerability\",\n        subtitle: \"And in a crisis... voice calls fail. When seconds matter, you can't unlock a screen. And once a phone is lost... the evidence is gone.\",\n        type: \"vulnerability\"\n      },\n      {\n        start: 17,\n        end: 22,\n        title: \"Scene 03 • Protection. Redefined.\",\n        subtitle: \"We believe safety shouldn't depend on luck. It should be engineered into every second.\",\n        type: \"reveal\"\n      },\n      {\n        start: 22,\n        end: 34,\n        title: \"Scene 04 • 15s Covert SOS Video Vault\",\n        subtitle: \"Introducing SAFE BD. With a covert tap—even while your screen remains dark—it captures 15 seconds of encrypted audio and video straight to the cloud vault.\",\n        type: \"sos_vault\"\n      },\n      {\n        start: 34,\n        end: 44,\n        title: \"Scene 05 • 'Walk With Me' Transit Companion\",\n        subtitle: \"For late-night commutes, 'Walk With Me' watches over your journey. Live satellite tracking. Intelligent traffic modeling. And automated dead-man timers.\",\n        type: \"transit\"\n      },\n      {\n        start: 44,\n        end: 52,\n        title: \"Scene 06 • Connected Guardians & Civic Shield\",\n        subtitle: \"Direct integration with 999, automated WhatsApp alerts for your family, and verified civic hazard intelligence for your community.\",\n        type: \"network\"\n      },\n      {\n        start: 52,\n        end: 60,\n        title: \"Scene 07 • SAFE BD — Peace of Mind\",\n        subtitle: \"Because the most advanced technology isn't just about what changes your life... It's about what protects it. SAFE BD.\",\n        type: \"outro\"\n      }\n    ];\n\n    // --- Playback State ---\n    let isPlaying = false;\n    let currentTime = 0;\n    const duration = 60;\n    let lastTimestamp = 0;\n    let voiceEnabled = true;\n    let currentSubtitleIndex = -1;\n    let isRecording = false;\n    let mediaRecorder = null;\n    let recordedChunks = [];\n\n    // --- Canvas & DOM ---\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('stageCanvas');\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n    const startOverlay = document.getElementById('startOverlay');\n    const quickStartBtn = document.getElementById('quickStartBtn');\n    const bigPlayBtn = document.getElementById('bigPlayBtn');\n    const ctrlPlayBtn = document.getElementById('ctrlPlayBtn');\n    const playIcon = document.getElementById('playIcon');\n    const pauseIcon = document.getElementById('pauseIcon');\n    const ctrlRestartBtn = document.getElementById('ctrlRestartBtn');\n    const progressBar = document.getElementById('progressBar');\n    const progressBarContainer = document.getElementById('progressBarContainer');\n    const timeCurrent = document.getElementById('timeCurrent');\n    const subtitleBox = document.getElementById('subtitleBox');\n    const sceneBadge = document.getElementById('sceneBadge');\n    const cadBadge = document.getElementById('cadBadge');\n    const voiceToggleBtn = document.getElementById('voiceToggleBtn');\n    const voiceStatusText = document.getElementById('voiceStatusText');\n    const downloadVideoBtn = document.getElementById('downloadVideoBtn');\n    const recordingTag = document.getElementById('recordingTag');\n\n    // --- Web Audio Cinematic Synthesizer ---\n    let audioCtx = null;\n    let masterGain = null;\n    let synthDestination = null;\n\n    function initAudio() {\n      if (!audioCtx) {\n        const AudioContext = window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext;\n        audioCtx = new AudioContext();\n        masterGain = audioCtx.createGain();\n        masterGain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.35, audioCtx.currentTime);\n        synthDestination = audioCtx.createMediaStreamDestination();\n        masterGain.connect(audioCtx.destination);\n        masterGain.connect(synthDestination);\n      }\n      if (audioCtx.state === 'suspended') {\n        audioCtx.resume();\n      }\n    }\n\n    function playCinematicAudioCues(t) {\n      if (!audioCtx) return;\n      // Pulse beat\n      if (t < 17 && Math.floor(t * 1.5) % 2 === 0 && Math.random() < 0.2) {\n        const osc = audioCtx.createOscillator();\n        const g = audioCtx.createGain();\n        osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(60, audioCtx.currentTime);\n        g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.3, audioCtx.currentTime);\n        g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, audioCtx.currentTime + 0.25);\n        osc.connect(g);\n        g.connect(masterGain);\n        osc.start();\n        osc.stop(audioCtx.currentTime + 0.25);\n      }\n      // Synth Arp\n      if (t >= 17 && t < 58 && Math.floor(t * 3) % 3 === 0 && Math.random() < 0.15) {\n        const osc = audioCtx.createOscillator();\n        const g = audioCtx.createGain();\n        osc.type = 'triangle';\n        osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(320, audioCtx.currentTime);\n        osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(640, audioCtx.currentTime + 0.2);\n        g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.07, audioCtx.currentTime);\n        g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, audioCtx.currentTime + 0.2);\n        osc.connect(g);\n        g.connect(masterGain);\n        osc.start();\n        osc.stop(audioCtx.currentTime + 0.2);\n      }\n    }\n\n    // --- Voiceover Synthesis ---\n    function speakSubtitle(text) {\n      if (!voiceEnabled || !('speechSynthesis' in window)) return;\n      window.speechSynthesis.cancel();\n      const utterance = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(text);\n      utterance.rate = 0.93;\n      utterance.pitch = 0.98;\n      const voices = window.speechSynthesis.getVoices();\n      const preferred = voices.find(v => v.lang.startsWith('en') && (v.name.includes('Natural') || v.name.includes('Google') || v.name.includes('Samantha')));\n      if (preferred) utterance.voice = preferred;\n      window.speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);\n    }\n\n    // --- Helper: Draw Image with Ken Burns Camera Zoom ---\n    function drawKenBurns(image, zoomStart, zoomEnd, progress, alpha = 1) {\n      if (!image.complete || image.naturalWidth === 0) return;\n      const w = canvas.width;\n      const h = canvas.height;\n      const currentZoom = zoomStart + (zoomEnd - zoomStart) * progress;\n      const dw = w * currentZoom;\n      const dh = h * currentZoom;\n      const dx = (w - dw) / 2;\n      const dy = (h - dh) / 2;\n\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.globalAlpha = alpha;\n      ctx.drawImage(image, dx, dy, dw, dh);\n      ctx.restore();\n    }\n\n    // --- Frame Rendering ---\n    function renderFrame(t) {\n      const w = canvas.width;\n      const h = canvas.height;\n\n      // Dark background fill\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#060305';\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\n      const sceneIndex = TIMELINE.findIndex(item => t >= item.start && t < item.end);\n      const scene = TIMELINE[sceneIndex] || TIMELINE[TIMELINE.length - 1];\n\n      // Update HUD\n      if (sceneIndex !== currentSubtitleIndex) {\n        currentSubtitleIndex = sceneIndex;\n        subtitleBox.innerText = `\"${scene.subtitle}\"`;\n        sceneBadge.innerText = scene.title;\n        if (scene.type === 'sos_vault' || scene.type === 'transit') {\n          cadBadge.classList.remove('hidden');\n        } else {\n          cadBadge.classList.add('hidden');\n        }\n        if (isPlaying) speakSubtitle(scene.subtitle);\n      }\n\n      const sceneElapsed = t - scene.start;\n      const sceneProgress = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, sceneElapsed / (scene.end - scene.start)));\n\n      // Render Active Scene\n      if (scene.type === 'streets') {\n        // Scene 1: Dhaka dusk street with Ken Burns zoom & rain lighting\n        drawKenBurns(imgStreet, 1.0, 1.08, sceneProgress, 1.0);\n        // Vignette\n        renderDarkVignette(w, h, 0.45);\n        // Onscreen text\n        renderCenteredTitle('50 MILLION CITIZENS', 'Commuting into the night.');\n\n      } else if (scene.type === 'vulnerability') {\n        // Scene 2: Shaken / Glitched Street image + shattered screen\n        const glitchX = Math.sin(t * 30) > 0.8 ? (Math.random() - 0.5) * 16 : 0;\n        ctx.save();\n        ctx.translate(glitchX, 0);\n        drawKenBurns(imgStreet, 1.08, 1.15, sceneProgress, 0.6);\n        ctx.restore();\n        renderDarkVignette(w, h, 0.7);\n\n        // Crack wireframe\n        ctx.save();\n        ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.8)';\n        ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n        ctx.strokeRect(w / 2 - 140, h / 2 - 240, 280, 480);\n        ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5)';\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.moveTo(w / 2 - 140, h / 2 - 80);\n        ctx.lineTo(w / 2 + 20, h / 2 + 10);\n        ctx.lineTo(w / 2 + 140, h / 2 + 100);\n        ctx.moveTo(w / 2 + 20, h / 2 + 10);\n        ctx.lineTo(w / 2 - 50, h / 2 + 180);\n        ctx.stroke();\n\n        ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#ef4444';\n        ctx.font = '800 24px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('CRITICAL EMERGENCY GAP', w / 2, h / 2 - 10);\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#cbd5e1';\n        ctx.font = '600 16px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('When phones are snatched, voice calls fail.', w / 2, h / 2 + 30);\n        ctx.restore();\n\n      } else if (scene.type === 'reveal') {\n        // Scene 3: Hero Product Reveal with glowing crimson sonar rings\n        drawKenBurns(imgHero, 1.15, 1.05, sceneProgress, 0.85);\n        renderDarkVignette(w, h, 0.4);\n\n        // Sonar Wave\n        const pulse = (sceneProgress * 300) % 180 + 30;\n        ctx.save();\n        ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.7)';\n        ctx.lineWidth = 3;\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(w / 2, h / 2 - 40, pulse, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        ctx.stroke();\n\n        ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#ffffff';\n        ctx.font = '900 68px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('SAFE BD', w / 2, h / 2 + 80);\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#ef4444';\n        ctx.font = '800 22px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('PROTECTION. REDEFINED.', w / 2, h / 2 + 120);\n        ctx.restore();\n\n      } else if (scene.type === 'sos_vault') {\n        // Scene 4: Covert SOS Video Vault (Hero + Data Stream)\n        drawKenBurns(imgHero, 1.05, 1.0, sceneProgress, 0.75);\n        renderDarkVignette(w, h, 0.5);\n\n        // Holographic Data Stream Pills\n        ctx.save();\n        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(15, 8, 12, 0.9)';\n        ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.8)';\n        ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.roundRect(w * 0.08, h * 0.25, 420, 240, 20);\n        ctx.fill();\n        ctx.stroke();\n\n        ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#ef4444';\n        ctx.font = '800 20px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('COVERT SOS VIDEO VAULT', w * 0.08 + 24, h * 0.25 + 40);\n\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#10b981';\n        ctx.font = '700 13px monospace';\n        ctx.fillText('• 3x Power-Button Click: TRIGGERED', w * 0.08 + 24, h * 0.25 + 80);\n        ctx.fillText('• Screen Status: PITCH BLACK (Covert)', w * 0.08 + 24, h * 0.25 + 110);\n        ctx.fillText('• 15s AES-256 MP4 Cloud Vault: LOCKED', w * 0.08 + 24, h * 0.25 + 140);\n        ctx.fillText('• 999 CAD Dispatch: LIVE STREAM READY', w * 0.08 + 24, h * 0.25 + 170);\n\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#94a3b8';\n        ctx.font = '500 13px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('Even if phone is smashed, attacker is identified.', w * 0.08 + 24, h * 0.25 + 210);\n        ctx.restore();\n\n      } else if (scene.type === 'transit') {\n        // Scene 5: 999 CAD Console & \"Walk With Me\"\n        drawKenBurns(imgCad, 1.0, 1.06, sceneProgress, 0.9);\n        renderDarkVignette(w, h, 0.4);\n\n        // Overlay Card\n        ctx.save();\n        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(15, 8, 12, 0.92)';\n        ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.8)';\n        ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.roundRect(w * 0.08, h * 0.2, 380, 200, 18);\n        ctx.fill();\n        ctx.stroke();\n\n        ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#fbbf24';\n        ctx.font = '800 20px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('\"WALK WITH ME\" ACTIVE', w * 0.08 + 24, h * 0.2 + 40);\n\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#f8fafc';\n        ctx.font = '600 14px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('Real-Time Route Telemetry (32 km/h)', w * 0.08 + 24, h * 0.2 + 80);\n        ctx.fillText('Dhaka Traffic Congestion Modeling', w * 0.08 + 24, h * 0.2 + 110);\n\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#10b981';\n        ctx.font = '700 13px monospace';\n        ctx.fillText('• Automated Dead-Man Timer: ACTIVE', w * 0.08 + 24, h * 0.2 + 150);\n        ctx.restore();\n\n      } else if (scene.type === 'network') {\n        // Scene 6: Connected Guardians & 999 CAD\n        drawKenBurns(imgCad, 1.06, 1.12, sceneProgress, 0.8);\n        renderDarkVignette(w, h, 0.55);\n\n        ctx.save();\n        ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#ffffff';\n        ctx.font = '800 40px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('UNIFIED PUBLIC SAFETY', w / 2, h / 2 - 30);\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#10b981';\n        ctx.font = '700 18px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('999 Police CAD  •  1-Tap Family WhatsApp GPS  •  Civic Feed', w / 2, h / 2 + 20);\n        ctx.restore();\n\n      } else if (scene.type === 'outro') {\n        // Scene 7: Climax & Outro with Hero Promo\n        drawKenBurns(imgHero, 1.0, 1.05, sceneProgress, 0.95);\n        renderDarkVignette(w, h, 0.45);\n\n        ctx.save();\n        ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#ffffff';\n        ctx.font = '900 70px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('SAFE BD', w / 2, h / 2 + 30);\n\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#fca5a5';\n        ctx.font = '700 20px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n        ctx.fillText('National Citizen Safety & Transit Protection', w / 2, h / 2 + 75);\n\n        ctx.fillStyle = '#94a3b8';\n        ctx.font = '600 14px monospace';\n        ctx.fillText('In Official Coordination with 999 • safebd.gov.bd', w / 2, h / 2 + 115);\n        ctx.restore();\n      }\n\n      // Cinematic Letterbox\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#000000';\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, 40);\n      ctx.fillRect(0, h - 40, w, 40);\n    }\n\n    function renderDarkVignette(w, h, opacity) {\n      const grad = ctx.createRadialGradient(w / 2, h / 2, w * 0.2, w / 2, h / 2, w * 0.75);\n      grad.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');\n      grad.addColorStop(1, `rgba(0,0,0,${opacity})`);\n      ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\n    }\n\n    function renderCenteredTitle(title, subtitle) {\n      const w = canvas.width;\n      const h = canvas.height;\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95)';\n      ctx.font = '800 42px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n      ctx.fillText(title, w / 2, h / 2 - 10);\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(203, 213, 225, 0.85)';\n      ctx.font = '500 20px \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"';\n      ctx.fillText(subtitle, w / 2, h / 2 + 35);\n      ctx.restore();\n    }\n\n    // --- Main Tick Loop ---\n    function step(timestamp) {\n      if (!lastTimestamp) lastTimestamp = timestamp;\n      const delta = (timestamp - lastTimestamp) / 1000;\n      lastTimestamp = timestamp;\n\n      if (isPlaying) {\n        currentTime += delta;\n        playCinematicAudioCues(currentTime);\n\n        if (currentTime >= duration) {\n          currentTime = duration;\n          pauseCommercial();\n        }\n      }\n\n      const progressPercent = (currentTime / duration) * 100;\n      progressBar.style.width = `${progressPercent}%`;\n\n      const curM = Math.floor(currentTime / 60);\n      const curS = Math.floor(currentTime % 60).toString().padStart(2, '0');\n      timeCurrent.innerText = `${curM}:${curS}`;\n\n      renderFrame(currentTime);\n      requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }\n\n    // --- Controls ---\n    function playCommercial() {\n      initAudio();\n      isPlaying = true;\n      startOverlay.classList.add('hidden');\n      playIcon.classList.add('hidden');\n      pauseIcon.classList.remove('hidden');\n      lastTimestamp = 0;\n      const sceneIndex = TIMELINE.findIndex(item => currentTime >= item.start && currentTime < item.end);\n      if (sceneIndex >= 0 && voiceEnabled) {\n        speakSubtitle(TIMELINE[sceneIndex].subtitle);\n      }\n    }\n\n    function pauseCommercial() {\n      isPlaying = false;\n      playIcon.classList.remove('hidden');\n      pauseIcon.classList.add('hidden');\n      if (window.speechSynthesis) window.speechSynthesis.cancel();\n    }\n\n    function togglePlay() {\n      if (isPlaying) pauseCommercial();\n      else playCommercial();\n    }\n\n    function restartCommercial() {\n      currentTime = 0;\n      currentSubtitleIndex = -1;\n      playCommercial();\n    }\n\n    function seekTo(targetSec) {\n      currentTime = Math.max(0, Math.min(duration, targetSec));\n      currentSubtitleIndex = -1;\n      renderFrame(currentTime);\n      if (isPlaying) {\n        const sceneIndex = TIMELINE.findIndex(item => currentTime >= item.start && currentTime < item.end);\n        if (sceneIndex >= 0 && voiceEnabled) {\n          speakSubtitle(TIMELINE[sceneIndex].subtitle);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    // --- Video Recorder & Downloader ---\n    async function startVideoExport() {\n      initAudio();\n      if (isRecording) return;\n      isRecording = true;\n      recordingTag.classList.remove('hidden');\n      downloadVideoBtn.disabled = true;\n      downloadVideoBtn.innerHTML = `<span>Exporting (Please wait)...</span>`;\n\n      currentTime = 0;\n      currentSubtitleIndex = -1;\n\n      const canvasStream = canvas.captureStream(60);\n      let combinedStream = canvasStream;\n      if (synthDestination && synthDestination.stream) {\n        combinedStream = new MediaStream([\n          ...canvasStream.getVideoTracks(),\n          ...synthDestination.stream.getAudioTracks()\n        ]);\n      }\n\n      recordedChunks = [];\n      try {\n        const mimeType = MediaRecorder.isTypeSupported('video/webm;codecs=vp9')\n          ? 'video/webm;codecs=vp9'\n          : 'video/webm';\n        \n        mediaRecorder = new MediaRecorder(combinedStream, { mimeType, videoBitsPerSecond: 6000000 });\n\n        mediaRecorder.ondataavailable = (e) => {\n          if (e.data.size > 0) recordedChunks.push(e.data);\n        };\n\n        mediaRecorder.onstop = () => {\n          const blob = new Blob(recordedChunks, { type: 'video/webm' });\n          const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n          const a = document.createElement('a');\n          a.style.display = 'none';\n          a.href = url;\n          a.download = 'SAFE_BD_60s_Commercial.webm';\n          document.body.appendChild(a);\n          a.click();\n          setTimeout(() => {\n            document.body.removeChild(a);\n            window.URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\n          }, 100);\n\n          isRecording = false;\n          recordingTag.classList.add('hidden');\n          downloadVideoBtn.disabled = false;\n          downloadVideoBtn.innerHTML = `\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96zM17 13l-5 5-5-5h3V9h4v4h3z\"/></svg>\n            <span>Export &amp; Download Video</span>\n          `;\n        };\n\n        mediaRecorder.start();\n        playCommercial();\n\n        const checkInterval = setInterval(() => {\n          if (currentTime >= 59.8 || !isPlaying) {\n            clearInterval(checkInterval);\n            if (mediaRecorder && mediaRecorder.state !== 'inactive') {\n              mediaRecorder.stop();\n            }\n          }\n        }, 200);\n\n      } catch (err) {\n        console.error(\"Recording error:\", err);\n        isRecording = false;\n        recordingTag.classList.add('hidden');\n        downloadVideoBtn.disabled = false;\n      }\n    }\n\n    // --- Listeners ---\n    quickStartBtn.addEventListener('click', playCommercial);\n    bigPlayBtn.addEventListener('click', playCommercial);\n    ctrlPlayBtn.addEventListener('click', togglePlay);\n    ctrlRestartBtn.addEventListener('click', restartCommercial);\n    downloadVideoBtn.addEventListener('click', startVideoExport);\n\n    voiceToggleBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      voiceEnabled = !voiceEnabled;\n      voiceStatusText.innerText = `Voice: ${voiceEnabled ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`;\n      if (!voiceEnabled && window.speechSynthesis) window.speechSynthesis.cancel();\n    });\n\n    progressBarContainer.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n      const rect = progressBarContainer.getBoundingClientRect();\n      const clickX = e.clientX - rect.left;\n      seekTo((clickX / rect.width) * duration);\n    });\n\n    // Start rendering\n    renderFrame(0);\n    requestAnimationFrame(step);\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Upgraded SAFE BD commercial video player with real AI keyframe imagery, Ken Burns zooms, synced Web Audio, voiceover, and video export","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\B\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\24bac50d-4c2d-4734-a270-fe35dfea2990\\SAFE_BD_Commercial_Video.html","toolAction":"Updating video player artifact","toolSummary":"Update commercial video player artifact"}}]}
